---
import SectionHeading from '../SectionHeading.astro';
import Collage from '../in-use/Collage.astro';
---

<section id="in-use" class="scroll-mt-28 py-16">
  <SectionHeading
    eyebrow="In use"
    title="When it all comes together"
    lead="What it looks like when the logo, color, type and words meet on real pieces. Every piece here is built from the brand assets only, and every photo spot is waiting for one of yours."
  />
  <Collage />
  <p class="m-0 mt-6 text-[length:var(--type-footnote-size)] text-[var(--label-secondary)]">
    The website piece uses the positioning line and the primary line from masschallenge.org, read
    on 2026-11-11. Everything else is placeholder text for you to replace.
  </p>
</section>
